        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>NGP 24 x 24 Fusible Link Louver Kit</b>\r\n<p>\r\nFor 24\" x 24\" door cutout.  Fusible Link  louver kit with mitered corners including reinforcing clips. For 1-3/4\" thick, wood or hollow metal fire doors up to 90 minutes. Blades close when activates by fire/heat (165 Degrees Fusible Link). Made in the USA.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nGray primer powder coat finish.  Packaged with #8 x 3/4\" Phillips head sheet metal screws (SMS). Frame is made from 18 gauge cold roller steel and the adjustable louvers blades are 18 gauge steel.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/kaba-simplex-902-size.gif?v=1704354717\" width=\"100\" height=\"72\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Made in the USA\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for NGP L-1900-24x24 Fusible Link Louver Kit\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Door Cut Out Width: 24\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Cut Out Height: 24\"</li>\r\n<li>Frame Projection Off Door: 3/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: 1-3/4\" Thick Door</li>\r\n<li>Fusible Link: 165 Degrees F</li>\r\n<li>Installation Screws: #8 x 3/4\" Phillips head SMS</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/L-1900_cutsheet.pdf?v=1704262415\" target=\"new\"><b>NGP L-1900 Cutsheet (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>*Sold Individually.</b>\r\n</p>",
